      <gmd:supplementalInformation>
        <gco:CharacterString><![CDATA[Each folder (YYYYMMDD) has 5 AWAC (Nortek Acoustic Wave and  Current Profiler) data files and one image file (along and across-channel velocity distributions along the ship channel): It should be noted that the submitted data are raw data and have not yet been quality controlled.  Positions can be extracted from the NMEA sentences.|||||]]></gco:CharacterString>
